### Solution:
```java
public int countPrefixOccurrences(String unsegmentedWord, String prefix) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i <= unsegmentedWord.length() - prefix.length(); i++) {
        if (unsegmentedWord.substring(i, i + prefix.length()).equals(prefix)) {
