Write a function `calculateAverageUSDValue` that accepts an array of `IBacktestDataPointDto` objects and returns the average `usdValue`.

Function Signature: `function calculateAverageUSDValue(dataPoints: IBacktestDataPointDto[]): number`

Example:
```typescript
const dataPoints: IBacktestDataPointDto[] = [
    { time: "2022-01-01", usdValue: 100 },
    { time: "2022-01-02", usdValue: 150 },
    { time: "2022-01-03", usdValue: 200 }
];

console.log(calculateAverageUSDValue(dataPoints)); // Output: 150
```

### Solution:
```typescript
function calculateAverageUSDValue(dataPoints: IBacktestDataPointDto[]): number {
    if (dataPoints.length === 0) {
        return 0;
    }

